{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK17SupportedVersionsO22isSwiftSixLanguageModeSbvpZ","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","roleHeading":"Type Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when built by a 6.0+ toolchain, which selects ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package@swift-6.0.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its per-target language-mode setting. Reported rather than assumed, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference is invisible from the outside and decides whether the concurrency","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guarantees were checked or merely intended.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This reads the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"language mode"}]},{"text":", not the toolchain: ","type":"text"},{"code":"#if swift(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tests the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"former and ","type":"text"},{"code":"#if compiler(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the latter, and they genuinely differ in this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package. On a 6.x toolchain the library and the examples are built in Swift 6","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mode while the test target is deliberately still built in Swift 5 mode — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library and examples compile clean under full strict-concurrency checking and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"test harness does not, so scoping the mode to the targets that actually ship is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what makes the guarantee about the artifact you get rather than about a rewrite of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the test suite.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this library"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode."}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamSDK","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions","title":"SupportedVersions","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of Swift versions this SDK is built and tested against."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions/isSwiftSixLanguageMode":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this library"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}]}}}